		{"id":"55b25a57940d2356","type":"text","text":"Gather Dice. Gain die for each:\n- One for good luck\n- A relevant **skill**\n- A relevant **domain**\n- A relevant **mastery**\n- **Help**\n- Any **advantage**s from an item, the environment, or setup","x":-350,"y":80,"width":280,"height":320},
